### ==============================================================================
### QORVENZ TECH — VS CODE REST CLIENT REQUEST COLLECTION
### Install extension: "humao.rest-client"
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@webUrl = http://localhost:5173

### 1. Health Check Endpoint (Backend + PostgreSQL status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. API v1 Welcome & Module Manifest
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Frontend Dev Server Root
GET {{webUrl}}

### 4. Health Check via Frontend Proxy
GET {{webUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 5. 404 Error Test
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/non-existent-endpoint
Accept: application/json
